text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181C35 {
    "This is MAUVILLE GAME CORNER."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181C53 {
    "Okay, you wanted some COINS for\nthe games?\pBut you don’t have a COIN CASE for\nstowing the COINS."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181CB4 {
    "Were you looking for COINS?\pIt’s ¥1000 for 50 COINS.\nWould you like some?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181CFE {
    "Thank you very much!\nHere are your COINS!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181D28 {
    "Um... You don’t appear to have\nenough money..."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181D57 {
    "Oh?\nYour COIN CASE is full."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181D73 {
    "Oh... You don’t need COINS, then?\nGood luck on your adventure!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181DE1 {
    "Welcome.\pYou can exchange your COINS for\nprizes here."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181E17 {
    "Which prize would you like?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181E33 {
    "So your choice is {STR_VAR_1}?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181E49 {
    "Thank you!\nWe’ll send it to your PC at home."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181E76 {
    "You don’t have enough COINS."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181EC2 {
    "Oh, is that so? \nYou need to save some COINS before\lcoming back here."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181F08 {
    "Here you go!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181F3D {
    "I made a mistake and got two of the\nsame DOLLS.\pWould you like one of them?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181F89 {
    "There you go!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181F97 {
    "Huh?\nYou want it, but not right now?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181FBC {
    "Oh, don’t be so negative!\nYou can have this!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08181FE9 {
    "There’s a prize I want, but I can’t win\nthe jackpot."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_0818201E {
    "Hey, kid, if you want to play here,\nyou need a COIN CASE.\pI think the young lady next door\nhad one. Go see her!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_0818208E {
    "My luck can only last so long.\nThis is too much for me.\lHere, take some COINS!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_081820DD {
    "MAUVILLE has something for\neveryone.\pFor me, it’s the GAME CORNER."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08182120 {
    "The ROULETTE tables have different\nrates.\pCheck your COINS if you’re going to\npick a table."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_0818217C {
    "It’s easy to lose track of time in here. \nI should get back to work."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_081821C1 {
    "COINS are needed to play here in the\nGAME CORNER."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_081821F3 {
    "This ROULETTE thing...\nIt’s rather demanding.\pWin or lose, it’s only by luck."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08182241 {
    "Up to three COINS can be used to play\nthe SLOTS."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08182272 {
    "It’s very difficult to make it stop\nright on “7.”\pIf it stops on “7” during the REEL TIME\nbonus game, you’ll receive extra COINS."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_081822F4 {
    "Here’s some information for you\nabout the SLOTS.\pThe more lightning bolts you stock, the\nmore REEL TIME chances you get.\pIn a game with the maximum five REEL\nTIME chances...\pIt is possible to receive four regular\nbonuses, then a big bonus.\pThe big bonus is 660 COINS, but it’s\nvery difficult to get."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G10_M03_Text_08182420 {
    "You can’t play if you don’t have a\nCOIN CASE."
}
